## Reflection commands at a glance

| Command | Module | Output |
|---------|--------|--------|
| `#stratify f` | `AristoTask` | primal `size / cell / depth` |
| `#dualstratify f` | `DualAtlas` | dual `cognitive index / semantic triad / harmonic cell` |
| `#atlas f` | `DualAtlas` | combined primal + dual report |

Each command reflects on `f`'s declaration value, takes `e.hash.toNat`, and runs
the corresponding projection(s).

